{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482125-roleplaying-teaching-a-path-of-enlightenment","id":1482125,"title":"Roleplaying teaching a Path of Enlightenment","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-27T20:58:45-07:00","id":1482125,"title":"Roleplaying teaching a Path of Enlightenment","content":"I'm running a V5 Sabbat game. The Pack is on the Path of the Feral Heart. One of the tenets of that Path in my game is that you must always ride the wave of frenzy, never resist the frenzy outright. Mind you, riding the wave in my game is more flexible than V5 RAW as there is no longer an Instincts virtue, so I have to approximate it.<br /> <br /> Tonight the Pack Priest roleplayed teaching someone how to resist a fear of fire when your Path tenets demand that you always ride the wave. She said that when you feel the fear frenzy start to take you, channel that fear into the fear of failing your Pack, protecting your Pack also being a tenet of Feral Heart. Let the frenzy take you, but channel it into seeing the other side of the fire as an enemy that must be reached or else you will have endangered your Pack with your weakness. And thus defeat fear frenzy by turning it into a brief fury frenzy.<br /> <br /> It was really enjoyable roleplay and really highlighted the difference between resisting the beast vs channeling the beast.<br /> <br /> What kind of experiences have you had with characters teaching other characters Paths of Enlightenment?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-28T05:23:26-07:00","id":1482140,"title":"","content":"An old character of mine had kept a ghoul romantic interest. When he moved to Path of Power and Inner Voice, his mentor made him kill her, as she was a source of weakness to him, since he did, in fact, care about her. <br /> <br /> He ended up failing the roll and dropped from Humanity 3 to 2. It was later revealed that my character kept a picture of the two of them, and this action caused him to be unable to pick up the Path. After weeks of further training, my character burned the picture, which the ST allowed another roll for, upon which he succeeded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27252-hades","name":"Hades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}